└── tests/
```

## Persistence Details

| Component | Storage | Helper |
|-----------|---------|--------|
| LangGraph Checkpoints | `checkpoints` table | `mask.checkpoints` |
| A2A Tasks | `tasks` table | `mask.a2a.create_database_task_store()` |
